1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:04,596
Your code, inputs, checkpoints and outputs belong to your job. Cannabis

2
00:00:04,596 --> 00:00:09,191
requires encryption for stored files and network transfers, as well as

3
00:00:09,191 --> 00:00:11,280
protection while your program runs.

4
00:00:11,700 --> 00:00:16,373
The execution design releases keys only into an attested environment that

5
00:00:16,373 --> 00:00:21,046
meets the job's policy. Each participating accelerator and network path must

6
00:00:21,046 --> 00:00:22,320
support that protection.

7
00:00:22,900 --> 00:00:27,932
Ordinary hardware compatibility alone is not enough. The confidential worker service

8
00:00:27,932 --> 00:00:32,963
still needs integration and review. Public payments and some scheduling metadata

9
00:00:32,963 --> 00:00:37,080
remain visible. Explore the design and help strengthen it.
